Article 27. Responsibility to ensure cyberinformation security for national 
important information systems 
1. The managing body of a national important information system shall: 
a/ Comply with the provisions of Clause 2, Article 25 of this Law; 
b/ Periodically have cyberinformation security risks assessed by a 
specialized organization designated by a competent state agency; 
c/ Take standby measures for information systems; 
d/ Plan and conduct drills in the protection of national important 
information systems.

